Stage 3 of 8: Choose Your Path

Once the farm feels easy, pick a guild; it defines your abilities for
the climb ahead. Browse the roster, the playstyle archetypes, and which
pairings work before committing.

Level at the adventurers guild with "advance". Experience costs grow
with each level, and your stats shape what your abilities can do.

You can handle normal advancement from anywhere. "remcost" is a safe,
read-only report of stat costs, available raises, caps, and experience
needed. Use "remadvance <stat>" to raise one stat or "remadvance level"
to buy every level you can currently afford. Guild advancement still
happens at your guild hall with "advance guild". Despite their names,
the rem commands work before remort.

Non-remort players may use "set autolevel on" to spend experience on
levels automatically; leave it off when you want to bank experience for
stat raises. Remort souls always level automatically.

